    "喜欢旅行和探索世界，也用 AI 做一些有趣的小产品。博客和作品集在 [makerjackie.com](https://makerjackie.com)。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I like traveling, exploring the world, and building small AI-powered products. Blog and portfolio at [makerjackie.com](https://makerjackie.com)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "喜欢旅行和探索世界，也用 AI 做一些有趣的小产品。博客和作品集在 [makerjackie.com](https://makerjackie.com)。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "喜歡旅行和探索世界，也用 AI 做一些有趣的小產品。博客和作品集在 [makerjackie.com](https://makerjackie.com)。"
          }
